0..79 Comment "//! A shared view kept in a region: it lives as long as the capability scope or"
80..160 Comment "//! the hold that opened the region rather than the access that lent it, and the"
161..240 Comment "//! held value stays frozen until the region ends. A region is a static extent,"
241..321 Comment "//! ordered by outlives and erased before anything runs: a value enters a region"
322..401 Comment "//! at any time and never leaves it. Lifetimes stated by control rather than by"
402..464 Comment "//! a reference type follow boats, \"References are like jumps\""
465..537 Comment "//! [boats-2024-references_are_jumps]; regions as ordered extents follow"
538..599 Comment "//! Koronkevich and Bowman, _Type Universes as Kripke Worlds_"
600..652 Comment "//! [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]."
653..656 Comment "//!"
